<title>USA: CCC BUYS 24,181 TONNES U.S. HRW WHEAT FOR ERITREA.</title>
<headline>CCC BUYS 24,181 TONNES U.S. HRW WHEAT FOR ERITREA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it bought 24,181 tonnes of U.S. hard red winter wheat for donation to Eritrea.</p>
<p>The CCC, which is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture, said the wheat was bought from Cargill Inc at $152.18 a tonne, FOB Minneapolis.</p>
<p>Shipment was set for August 24-September 13.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
